OL,3,ARussia strikes second major bridge in
OL,4,AKyiv, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian strike has hit a second major
OL,7,Fbridge in Kyiv, Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,8,Fhas said, as Russia ramps up attacks on
OL,9,Fcritical infrastructure in the
OL,10,FUkrainian capital.
OL,12,FThe attack on Saturday morning damaged
OL,13,Fthe road surface and trolleybus
OL,14,Foverhead wires on the Northern Bridge,
OL,15,FKlitschko said, causing traffic to be
OL,16,Fblocked.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
