OL,3,ARussia strikes second major bridge in
OL,4,AKyiv, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strike comes after another key
OL,7,Fbridge in the city, Southern Bridge,
OL,8,Fwas targeted multiple times by Russian
OL,9,Fdrones on Thursday and Friday, with
OL,10,FKlitschko earlier warning that such
OL,11,Fattacks were "tearing Kyiv apart".
OL,13,FThe Northern and Southern bridges link
OL,14,Fthe eastern and western parts of the
OL,15,Fcapital and had not been hit before
OL,16,FThursday, signalling a new stage in
OL,17,FMoscow's strategy.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
